    "method": "Adds Sonnet 5.5 and GPT-6.1 Sol to previous report snapshots. Same hidden suites and 70/15/15 rubric; serial runs. Eight models report 1310/1310 hidden assertions. Raw task metrics are retained as transcribed reported data, not newly measured harness results.",
